## A practical “do not build this yet” list

Avoid these in the first release:

- Your own payment processor or payout ledger
- Custom card-data handling
- A wallet or stored marketplace balance
- Complex split payments across multiple sellers in one cart
- Real-time chat
- Recommendation engine
- Social features
- Native iOS/Android apps
- International currencies and languages
- Automated sales-tax filing logic
- Custom shipping-rate engine
- Microservices

For a solo builder, a modular monolith—one codebase, one primary database, clean internal modules—is the sensible starting point.

